  "description": {
    "text": "Domino's Pizza's second Wakuwaku Pokémon Pack campaign, at its shops nationwide: from 26 October to 10 December 2009 the meal came with a holo pair of Slowpoke and Slowbro and a Domino's Pizza Original Secret Book, and from 11 December 2009 to 14 January 2010 with Slowpoke and Slowking and a deck shield. All three cards carry the Domino's Pizza logo; Slowpoke was printed twice, with the word たね (Basic) spelled out in one and the Basic Pokémon mark in the other.",
